(7348493, 1149185, 3216, '<td valign="top">A difficult image to rate. At first it seems like a lot of work goes into this but maybe this was done by taking the green/red channel all the way down which causes that weird cyan color on the vehicle. If the vehicle was left in its original/rust color, this would have been a much better image.</td>', 'A difficult image to rate. At first it seems like a lot of work goes into this but maybe this was done by taking the green/red channel all the way down which causes that weird cyan color on the vehicle. If the vehicle was left in its original/rust color, this would have been a much better image.', '2015-05-06 18:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
