(7348551, 1149339, 43191, '<td valign="top">absolutely love this. The composition, the shadows, the story it tells. The colour you chose to show fits perfectly with the black and white of the rest of the image.The bright light in the top corner is the only downfall, but it was obviously there and part of the scene when you took the shot so I haven''t deducted points for it.</td>', 'absolutely love this. The composition, the shadows, the story it tells. The colour you chose to show fits perfectly with the black and white of the rest of the image.The bright light in the top corner is the only downfall, but it was obviously there and part of the scene when you took the shot so I haven''t deducted points for it.', '2015-05-06 22:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
