(7350251, 1149301, 138630, '<td valign="top">One of my top choices with a 7 - I never got back to bump any, but I liked this a lot.  What I like best is that, with the exception of the bit of bushes in lower right, the scene could exist in selective color.  A house could be white and gray as could tiles, door hardware could be silver, porch lights turned on would be yellow.  And I love the geometry here.</td>', 'One of my top choices with a 7 - I never got back to bump any, but I liked this a lot.  What I like best is that, with the exception of the bit of bushes in lower right, the scene could exist in selective color.  A house could be white and gray as could tiles, door hardware could be silver, porch lights turned on would be yellow.  And I love the geometry here.', '2015-05-13 11:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
