(7350762, 1149353, 135744, '<td valign="top">There is something really special about this image and with a bit of processing could look even better.<br/> <br/>You may not be a fan of my processing but here are a couple of quick edits that I quite like. They are quite similar.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1149916" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1149916.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1149916.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1149916.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1149917" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1149917.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1149917.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1149917.jpg"/></a></td>', 'There is something really special about this image and with a bit of processing could look even better. You may not be a fan of my processing but here are a couple of quick edits that I quite like. They are quite similar.  ', '2015-05-15 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 0),
